Package: splsleep
Title: Sleep EMA Diary Data Cleaning Pipeline
Version: 1.3.8
Authors@R: c(
    person("Cyra", "Sloblucyra", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cyracaid@users.noreply.github.com")
  )
Author: Cyra Sloblucyra
Maintainer: Cyra Sloblucyra <cyracaid@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Reproducible R pipeline for cleaning sleep EMA diary data. Parses raw timestamps, detects and corrects temporal and duration errors through a human-in-the-loop CSV workflow, computes sleep metrics (TST, SOL, WASO, SE), and generates diagnostic and research-ready figures. Configurable via YAML — maps your dataset columns without code changes. v1.3.8 adds correction traceability (has_correction enum), a pipeline flow diagram, before/after delta impact visualization, and 68 tests.
